# Cloudflare Pages redirects (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/).
# These geo sections were removed from the site; send any lingering inbound
# links or bookmarks to a live equivalent instead of letting them 404.

# German, Italian and Portuguese were never launched as separate geos --
# send them to the country picker so visitors can pick a real match.
/de/*  /  301
/it/*  /  301
/pt/*  /  301

# French content now lives only under /bf/ (Burkina Faso); the old
# standalone /fr/ section has been removed.
/fr/*  /bf/  301
